      "message": "Since this patch still requires human intervention to set this persistent configuration why about simply run the following commands from the EC console ?\n\n    # Read MFR_GATECLK_DIS (0x1a) register - Verify that bit 15 is not set\n    ▶ i2cxfer r16 9 0x20 0x1a\n    0x1c00 [7168]\n    # Disable Power Save: set MFR_GATECLK_DIS bit 15\n    ▶ i2cxfer w16 9 0x20 0x1a 0x9c00\n    # Verify\n    ▶ i2cxfer r16 9 0x20 0x1a\n    0x9c00 [39936]\n    # Store in EEPROM\n    ▶ i2cxfer rlen 9 0x20 0x15 0x0\n    # Reboot and Verify\n    ▶ reboot\n    ▶ i2cxfer r16 9 0x20 0x1a\n    0x9c00 [39936]\n\n",
